Version 2.2.0 - 2026.05.18
Added new feature to show pins on your map and compass for the locations of surveys and treasure maps
The optional LibMapPins-1.0 and CustomCompassPins are needed to enable this feature
These pins are disabled by default; there are two different ways to enable or disable these pins
Via the settings panel for the addon
Via map filters
This feature was added because this addon already needs to maintain data about locations for surveys and treasure maps, so it made sense to use that data for map and compass pins as well and allow the user to streamline and consolidate features that used to require multiple addons down to one.[/list]

Moved strings to a separate language file for potential multilingual support
Fixed typo with the Alik'r Blacksmithing survey

